<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-10-22T22:33:00.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian Army conducted an airstrike in Nariño that killed eight ELN members and a separate bombing in the southwest killed eight ELN fighters, while President De la Espriella launched a total offensive against the ELN and dissident FARC in Arauca. A drone attack injured six police officers at a station and a Black Hawk crash left thirteen soldiers stranded in Cauca. An illegal gold mine collapse in southwestern Colombia killed fourteen miners and injured seven. A priest survived a cross falling on him in a church and a gang killed a preacher. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPdzJLUWRWTVVGM1RYU25aOExsRHpaX3UwZnVIb2F5bjlrOFRhQS1xYy1WXzRIZmZJRUpVQTE4M2ZQTFJrbEVhclZ6U3kzUTZhNGUtV3VwUjhrWm1vak10V09UUV9IVXR5Tk51ZFU5eVpxYWdTdXQzbVloVFBJR1JuU2FwNnJ5UFBVUDkxcGx2ajlBbmY4MGlKUHFFa190Snpkc01CaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bozeman Daily Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9mT0N3TGQ2RXlTUkEzbldzdDFOR0t4aXk2VkVHVUVfeDgwd0tKd3ZEcm5xR0xwN051bUYxMnBUejQwTHUzUjRVODdWUnpkSF9y?oc=5&quot;&gt;JFeed&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPNU9zOW91THYtcFBCbTJCdFJla0U2RFhxbUR5X1hPZTZmUkZRU3Btd0lvclJMdHFPVGVKbFhRTzVQcUNPVnZXQURIamdreVl2cFFwU3h4SXVIb0t3dDZYeHAtanZrd2xqU1RWREVTWWRreHRJYndqNjRoZFdwb1BTS0tMRkstMTk4NFIxMUt1SmZObEFkYVRqcFRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Report.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOMTJ3c2hrVXpaUkVyaWxndmgzWHNmckRrN1ZqckV5cExTV3ZSTTA4NGE1bTc1bDRZX1RISFRUNjA1S1JRM2NoTDBo